milestones_inns_intro "A message from your publisher:\n\n\"100 subscribers already! The board is impressed, but players keep complaining that there's nowhere to sleep. Show us a proper town and we'll send a bonus.\""
milestones_inns_goal "Have <inns_needed> {tag_inn}s in one region to earn {button_hl}$<inns_reward>{clear_hl} from your publisher."
milestones_inns_done "Your publisher sends {button_hl}$<inns_reward>{clear_hl}.\n\n\"Cosy. Keep growing!\""
milestones_smiths_intro "A message from your publisher:\n\n\"1,000 subscribers! Now they all want better swords. Give them somewhere to buy them.\""
milestones_smiths_goal "Have <smiths_needed> {tag_blacksmith}s in one region to earn {button_hl}$<smiths_reward>{clear_hl} from your publisher."
milestones_smiths_done "Your publisher sends {button_hl}$<smiths_reward>{clear_hl}.\n\n\"The forums are full of sword screenshots. Excellent.\""
milestones_landmarks_intro "A message from your publisher:\n\n\"5,000 subscribers! Marketing needs something for the trailer. Build us some sights worth seeing.\""
milestones_landmarks_goal "Have <landmarks_needed> {tag_landmark}s in one region to earn {button_hl}$<landmarks_reward>{clear_hl} from your publisher."
milestones_landmarks_done "Your publisher sends {button_hl}$<landmarks_reward>{clear_hl}.\n\n\"That's our trailer. Congratulations on hitting every milestone!\""
